                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "A warm and quiet little shop with two cats with very different personalities—one elegant, the other affectionate. The food selection is plentiful, and everything my friend and I ordered was delicious. There aren\u0027t many seats, and it gets increasingly crowded and almost full as lunchtime approaches.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "一間溫暖又安靜的小店，裡面有兩隻個性迥異的貓，一隻優雅，一隻可親。餐點選項不少，我和友人點的餐點都非常好吃。店內的座位不多，靠近中午的時候，人就越來越多，幾乎滿座。",
