                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "I haven\u0027t properly documented the beauty of this place before.\n\nI come here almost every time I return to Taipei.\n\nIt gives me the warmth of my dream home.\n\nThe owner has adorable pomelos and kumquats.\n\nThe food and drinks are delicious; everything is just perfect.\n\nI come here so often that I\u0027ve just grabbed a few photos of the food.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "一直都沒有好好的紀錄這裡的美好，\n我幾乎每次回台北我都會來。\n這裡給我一種我夢想的家的溫暖。\n闆娘養了可愛的柚子跟金桔\n食物飲料都很美味，一切都那麼剛好。\n實在太常來了，隨手拈來附上幾張食物照。",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
