                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "2025/09/06 Menu included. Payment via Jiekou (street payment). 390\n\n\nHidden in the alleys of Datong District, Shishidouliu boasts a warm and inviting atmosphere with thoughtful touches throughout. Upon being seated, you\u0027re immediately soothed by the adorable shop cat 🐈, before the food begins to whet your appetite. The signature Swedish fish soup is incredibly fragrant, warm and slightly exotic, each bite comforting and appetizing 🍲. I highly recommend trying their bagels, paired with handmade blueberry sauce—a perfect balance of sweet and sour, with a rich and complex flavor profile, making it a reason to return 🥯💜. The German sausage and oat yogurt are equally excellent, generously portioned and healthy. The Spanish homemade omelet is also highly praised, with its hearty filling. The staff are friendly and attentive, making for a very comfortable dining experience 😌. Whether you\u0027re treating yourself to a leisurely brunch or spending an afternoon with friends, this is a highly recommended place.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "2025/09/06   內附菜單   街口支付   390\n\n蕼蒔荳留隱身於大同區巷弄中，店內氛圍溫馨自在，處處感受得到小巧思。入座時先被可愛店貓療癒一番 🐈，隨即而來的餐點讓人食指大動。招牌瑞典魚湯香氣十足，溫潤帶點異國風情，每一口都暖心又開胃 🍲。推薦一定要試試他們的貝果，搭配手工藍莓醬，酸甜平衡、口感層次豐富，是回訪理由之一 🥯💜。德式肉腸與燕麥雜糧優格同樣表現出色，份量足且健康。西班牙家常蛋餅也很受好評，餡料實在。店員親切、服務貼心，整體用餐體驗相當舒服 😌。不論是給自己一個悠閒早午餐，還是與友共度午後，都很推薦這裡。",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
